---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Infrastructure Automation">

<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24">

    <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold">
        Infrastructure Automation
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 text-slate-400 text-lg">
        Automated Linux and Windows infrastructure using Ansible to deploy,
        configure, and manage enterprise systems consistently across the
        homelab environment.
    </p>

    <img
        src="/images/network-topology.png"
        alt="Infrastructure Automation"
        class="mt-12 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl"
    />

    <div class="mt-12 space-y-10">

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">
                Project Overview
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 leading-8">
                Built an automation platform using Ansible to manage Linux and
                Windows hosts from a centralized control node. The project
                includes inventories, playbooks, roles, SSH authentication,
                WinRM connectivity, and configuration management.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">
                Technologies Used
            </h2>

            <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">

                <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-4 py-2">
                    Ansible
                </span>

                <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-4 py-2">
                    Linux
                </span>

                <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-4 py-2">
                    Windows
                </span>

                <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-4 py-2">
                    SSH
                </span>

                <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-4 py-2">
                    WinRM
                </span>

                <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-4 py-2">
                    YAML
                </span>

            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">
                Features
            </h2>

            <ul class="mt-6 list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-400">

                <li>Linux Automation</li>

                <li>Windows Automation</li>

                <li>Playbooks</li>

                <li>Roles</li>

                <li>Inventory Management</li>

                <li>SSH Key Authentication</li>

                <li>WinRM Remote Management</li>

                <li>Configuration Management</li>

            </ul>
        </section>

    </div>

</section>

</BaseLayout>
